cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link back to https://rajahasil.co/data/"
type: dataset
title: "RajaHasil 4D Results Archive"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://rajahasil.co/data/"
repository: "https://github.com/rajahasil/togel"
authors:
  - name: "RajaHasil"
abstract: >-
  Four-digit (4D) draw results for 5 markets (Singapore, Hong Kong, Sydney, Toto Macau and Cambodia) between 2020-01-01 and 2026-10-28, compiled from publicly available third-party archive sites and released as JSON and CSV. Unofficial and unverified. The session field is a WIB label, not a verified timestamp.
keywords:
  - lottery results
  - 4D
  - open data
  - time series
  - Singapore
  - Hong Kong
  - Sydney
  - Macau
  - Cambodia
